#question(title: [Rational limits])[
  Consider the function
  $
    h(x) = ((x - 1)(2 + x))/(x^2 (x - 1)(2 - x)) .
  $

  - Find all real values $a$ for which $h(a)$
    is undefined.
  - For each such value of $a$, compute
    $display(lim_(x -> a^+) h(x))$ and
    $display(lim_(x -> a^-) h(x))$.
  - Based on your answer, and nothing else,
    try to sketch the graph of $h$.
]
